    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with or againts\u00a0you friends in this fast paced shared-screen multiplayer\u00a0 game !  <br>(1 to 4 players)\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill other players ! Defeat the Dragon ! And unlock all achievements !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403860/extras/b08ca652798a72c60ab4e8c2012a1156.avif?t=1737235042\" width=464 height=304 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the solo mode, two modes are available for multiplayer games.  <br>Do you want to fight against your friends ?  <br>Or work as a team against the multitude of enemies ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403860/extras/6539e9bde5508bda791abc9097362e6f.avif?t=1737235042\" data-has-big width=800 height=472 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 50\u00a0achievements are for you to unlock in solo mode, coop mode or competitive mode !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403860/extras/1f6f8a8474d102ff90c39209d55c99be.avif?t=1737235042\" width=411 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun !</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with or againts\u00a0you friends in this fast paced shared-screen multiplayer\u00a0 game !  <br>(1 to 4 players)\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill other players ! Defeat the Dragon ! And unlock all achievements !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403860/extras/b08ca652798a72c60ab4e8c2012a1156.avif?t=1737235042\" width=464 height=304 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the solo mode, two modes are available for multiplayer games.  <br>Do you want to fight against your friends ?  <br>Or work as a team against the multitude of enemies ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403860/extras/6539e9bde5508bda791abc9097362e6f.avif?t=1737235042\" data-has-big width=800 height=472 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 50\u00a0achievements are for you to unlock in solo mode, coop mode or competitive mode !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403860/extras/1f6f8a8474d102ff90c39209d55c99be.avif?t=1737235042\" width=411 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun !</p>",
